content.main_review:
The strengths of the paper are as follows:
+ The paper targets an important topic of co-searching for both the networks and their accelerators;
+ The authors provide a good summary of related works;
+ The target angel of gradient manipulation is interesting;

The weaknesses of the paper are below: 
- The technical contribution is limited because the proposed methods involve quite some hyper-parameters limiting their practicality;
- One main concern is that the authors do not evaluate their searched networks or accelerators with SOTA co-exploration/search works, making it difficult to evaluate the effectiveness of their method;
- The target accelerator space is quite limited, and thus the authors should evaluate their method against random or grid search.
